ue</surname><given-names>PW</given-names></name><name><surname>Wright</surname><given-names>AF</given-names></name><name><surname>Kinane</surname><given-names>DF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Clinical and genetic analysis of a large North European Caucasian family affected by early-onset periodontitis</article-title><source>Journal of Dental Research</source><year>2000</year><volume>79</volume><fpage>857</fpage><lpage>863</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10765960</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1177/00220345000790031201</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bergstrom</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Eliasson</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Preber</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cigarette smoking and periodontal bone loss</article-title><source>Journal of Periodontology</source><year>1991</year><volume>62</volume><fpage>242</fpage><lpage>246</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2037954</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bergstrom</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Floderus-Myrhed</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Co-twin control study of the relationship between smoking and some periodontal disease factors</article-title><source>Community Dentistry and Dental Oral Epidemiology</source><year>1983</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>113</fpage><lpage>116</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1600-0528.1983.tb01367.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Preber</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Bergstrom</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Occurrence of ging